---
import ContentLayout from '../layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
---

<ContentLayout title="Disclaimer - PasteDownloadApp" description="Disclaimer for PasteDownloadApp. General information only: no professional advice, and no guarantee of results from using this free tool." canonicalUrl="https://pastedownloadapp.com/disclaimer/" breadcrumbs={[{ name: "Home", href: "/" }, { name: "Disclaimer" }]}>
  <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "WebPage",
      "name": "Disclaimer - PasteDownloadApp",
      "description": "Disclaimer for PasteDownloadApp. General information only: no professional advice, and no guarantee of results from using this free tool.",
      "publisher": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "PasteDownloadApp"
      }
    }
  </script>

  <h1 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-[28px] font-semibold text-ink tracking-tight mt-0 mb-6 leading-tight text-balance">
    Disclaimer
  </h1>

  <div class="text-body text-base sm:text-[17px] leading-relaxed space-y-4 [&_h2]:text-ink [&_h2]:text-lg [&_h2]:sm:text-xl [&_h2]:font-semibold [&_h2]:tracking-tight [&_h2]:mt-8 [&_h2]:mb-2 [&_h2]:leading-tight [&_h3]:text-ink [&_h3]:text-base [&_h3]:sm:text-lg [&_h3]:font-semibold [&_h3]:tracking-tight [&_h3]:mt-6 [&_h3]:mb-2 [&_h3]:leading-tight [&_a]:text-link [&_a]:underline [&_a]:underline-offset-2 [&_a]:decoration-link/30 [&_a]:transition-colors [&_a:hover]:decoration-link">
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> September 2026</p>

    <h2>General Information Only</h2>
    <p>
      The content on this website, including the blog, guides, and the PasteDownloadApp tool itself, is provided for general informational purposes only. It reflects how the tool and various browsers behaved at the time each page was written or last updated, not a permanent guarantee of behavior.
    </p>

    <h2>No Professional Advice</h2>
    <p>
      Nothing on this site constitutes legal, technical, or any other form of professional advice. Blog posts that explain browser APIs, file formats, or troubleshooting steps are written to help with a specific, common problem, not to replace the documentation of the browser or service you are actually using. Verify anything critical against the current, official documentation before relying on it.
    </p>

    <h2>Accuracy of Test Results and Guides</h2>
    <p>
      Several articles include real numbers, such as file sizes, conversion results, or browser version behavior, gathered by testing the tool directly. Those results were accurate for the specific file, browser version, and operating system used at the time of testing. Browsers update frequently, and your own results with a different file, browser, or device may vary. We revisit guides when we notice browser behavior has changed, but we cannot guarantee every page reflects the very latest release of every browser.
    </p>

    <h2>No Guarantee of Results</h2>
    <p>
      Using PasteDownloadApp does not guarantee a specific outcome, such as a particular output file size, successful clipboard access on your specific device, or compatibility with every image host or format. The tool depends on your browser's own implementation of the Clipboard and Canvas APIs, which we do not control.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-Party Links and Services</h2>
    <p>
      This site links to third-party resources, including browser documentation (such as MDN Web Docs), and uses third-party services such as Google Fonts, Google Analytics, and Google AdSense, described in more detail in our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>. We do not control, endorse, or take responsibility for the accuracy or availability of any third-party site or service.
    </p>

    <h2>No Affiliate Relationships</h2>
    <p>
      PasteDownloadApp does not currently use affiliate links to recommend third-party products or services. Any external link on this site is included because it is relevant to the topic being discussed, not because of a paid or affiliate relationship.
    </p>

    <h2>"As Is" Tool, No Warranty</h2>
    <p>
      PasteDownloadApp is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis, without warranties of any kind, express or implied. We do not guarantee the tool or site will be uninterrupted, error-free, or free of bugs. The full terms governing your use of the Service, including limitation of liability, are set out in our <a href="/terms/">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to This Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this disclaimer from time to time as the site and tool evolve. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this disclaimer, please <a href="/contact/">contact us</a> or email <a href="mailto:hello@pastedownloadapp.com">hello@pastedownloadapp.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</ContentLayout>
